    <bpmn:process id="W_W849" name="W849. IT Disaster Recovery Site Activation &amp; Failover Execution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Primary data center outage (Davao HQ); or pre-emptive failover before major disaster (Signal No. 3+ in Davao)
Frequency: Target: never (preventive); actual: estimated 0–2 real activations per year
Volume: 1 failover event affects entire chain (all 200 stores, 4 DCs, ecommerce, all systems)
Owner: CIO
Participants: IT Infrastructure Team, Database Administrator, Network Engineer, Application Support, BC Manager, COO
Source: workflow W849 — IT Disaster Recovery Site Activation &amp; Failover Execution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W849_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W849_Lane1" name="CIO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W849_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W849_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W849_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W849_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W849_Lane2" name="IT Infrastructure Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W849_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W849_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W849_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W849_Lane3" name="Database Administrator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W849_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W849_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W849_Start5" name="Primary data center outage (Davao HQ); or pre-emptive failover before major disaster…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W849_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W849_Task6" name="Declare disaster — CIO confirms primary site failure or pre-emptive trigger…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Declare disaster — CIO confirms primary site failure or pre-emptive trigger; obtain CEO/COO authorization for DR activation
Responsible (R): CIO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W849_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W849_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W849_Task7" name="Activate DR communication — notify all IT staff, Store Managers (via backup…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Activate DR communication — notify all IT staff, Store Managers (via backup communication channel), and BC Manager; switch to satellite/backup network if primary network is affected
Responsible (R): CIO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W849_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W849_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W849_Task8" name="Execute failover sequence (automated runbook) — (a) DNS switchover to DR site…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute failover sequence (automated runbook) — (a) DNS switchover to DR site (Clark or Cebu), (b) promote DR database replicas to primary, (c) activate application servers at DR site, (d) redirect POS terminal connections, (e) re-establish ecommerce endpoint
Responsible (R): IT Infrastructure Team
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 30–60 min (target RTO: 1 hour)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W849_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W849_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W849_Task9" name="Validate system health — run automated smoke tests for all critical systems…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Validate system health — run automated smoke tests for all critical systems (POS, WMS, ecommerce, finance, HR); verify data integrity against last replication checkpoint (target RPO: 15 minutes)
Responsible (R): Database Administrator
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W849_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W849_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W849_Task10" name="Notify business users — all-clear communication to Store Managers that systems…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Notify business users — all-clear communication to Store Managers that systems are available; provide reconnection instructions for POS terminals
Responsible (R): CIO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W849_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W849_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W849_Task11" name="Monitor DR site performance — continuous monitoring for 72 hours; watch for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Monitor DR site performance — continuous monitoring for 72 hours; watch for capacity constraints, latency issues, and data consistency anomalies
Responsible (R): IT Infrastructure Team
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Continuous (72 hours)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W849_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W849_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W849_Task12" name="Plan and execute failback — once primary site is restored, schedule planned…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Plan and execute failback — once primary site is restored, schedule planned failback during low-traffic window; replicate DR data back to primary; validate and switch
Responsible (R): IT Infrastructure Team
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 4–8 hours (planned weekend)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W849_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W849_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W849_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W849_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W849_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-320 (ensure controlled execution — Crisis Response &amp; Recovery (PA-26.2).) | - operational: priority-tier DR peak-load allocation (POS &gt; ecommerce &gt; WMS &gt; analytics); operational: manual POS reconnection runbook for affected transactions at legacy stores
Owner: CIO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W849_Assoc15" sourceRef="W849_Annotation14" targetRef="W849_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W849_Flow16" sourceRef="W849_Start5" targetRef="W849_Task6" />
