        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-320 (ensure controlled execution — Crisis Response &amp; Recovery (PA-26.2).) | - operational: CEO / COO review and approval gate
Owner: CEO / COO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
